&lt;h3 id="Introduction"&gt;Introduction&lt;a class="anchor-link" href="https://www.colour-science.org/posts/gaussian-based-spectral-upsampling/#Introduction"&gt;¶&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
